{"title":"2014 Indonesia MO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2014 Indonesia MO</b> problems and solutions.  The first link contains the full set of test problems.  The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2014 Indonesia MO Problems\">2014 Indonesia MO Problems</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">2014 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7</a></l